     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "If you mean the **Nebula Award presented in 2024**, Best Novel went to ***The Saint of Bright Doors*** by **Vajra Chandrasekera**. SFWA announced it on June 8, 2024; those awards honored works published in 2023. \ue200cite\ue202turn0search2\ue202turn0search3\ue201\n\nOne wrinkle: the **\u201c2024 Nebula Awards\u201d** (for works published in 2024) were presented in June 2025, and that Best Novel winner was ***Someone You Can Build a Nest In*** by **John Wiswell**. \ue200cite\ue202turn0search0\ue202turn0search1\ue201\n\nSo for a direct comparison with the **2024 Hugo ceremony**, the answer is *The Saint of Bright Doors*."
     ]
